        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett represent the mechanistic splicing insight and antisense-platform contribution, though clinical development involved wider teams.",
        "maturity": "Durable clinical use and the broader development of splice-modulating medicines make the advance mature.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The degree to which one disease-specific success versus the wider antisense field should define the award requires judgment."
