        "nobel_worthiness": "Chaperonin-assisted protein folding revealed a fundamental cellular mechanism for achieving protein structure and proteostasis.",
        "attribution": "Horwich and Hartl form a clear, limited attribution for the decisive mechanistic work.",
        "maturity": "The mechanism is deeply integrated into modern cell biology and disease research.",
        "uncertainties": []
